### 專案控管 API 範例
### 先依 auth.http 的說明登入並設定 session、xsrf；登入者的角色要有 project:read、project:write、task:write、work-log:write
### （或列在 super-admin-subjects）。由上往下執行，新增取得的 id 會存成變數，後面的請求直接使用，可重複執行

### 1. 新增專案（code 由 basic-data 產生，例如 PRJ2610001）；建立者自動成為經理
# @no-cookie-jar
POST http://localhost:8080/api/project
Cookie: SPRING_CORE_SESSION={{session}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "官網改版",
  "description": "首頁與會員中心改版",
  "status": "ACTIVE",
  "startDate": "2026-10-01",
  "endDate": "2026-12-31",
  "color": "#1677FF"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("projectId", response.body.data.id);
%}

### 2. 查詢我參與的專案（沒有 project:admin 時只會查到自己是成員的），帶任務數、完成數、逾期數
# @no-cookie-jar
POST http://localhost:8080/api/project/queryPage
Cookie: SPRING_CORE_SESSION={{session}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "statuses": ["PLANNING", "ACTIVE"],
  "page": 1,
  "size": 20,
  "sort": [{ "field": "transTime", "direction": "desc" }]
}

### 3. 專案成員（剛建立時只有自己，角色 MANAGER）
# @no-cookie-jar
POST http://localhost:8080/api/project-member/query
Cookie: SPRING_CORE_SESSION={{session}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "projectId": {{projectId}}
}

> {%
    client.global.set("myUserId", response.body.data[0].userId);
    client.global.set("memberId", response.body.data[0].id);
%}

### 4. 唯一的經理不能降為成員 → 400
# @no-cookie-jar
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/project-member/{{memberId}}
Cookie: SPRING_CORE_SESSION={{session}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": "MEMBER"
}

### 5. 新增任務 A（指派給自己）
# @no-cookie-jar
POST http://localhost:8080/api/task
Cookie: SPRING_CORE_SESSION={{session}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "projectId": {{projectId}},
  "title": "首頁版型設計",
  "priority": "HIGH",
  "assigneeId": "{{myUserId}}",
  "startDate": "2026-10-15",
  "dueDate": "2026-10-20",
  "estimateHours": 16
}

> {%
    client.global.set("taskA", response.body.data.id);
%}

### 6. 新增任務 B，前置任務為 A（A 完成後才開始）
# @no-cookie-jar
POST http://localhost:8080/api/task
Cookie: SPRING_CORE_SESSION={{session}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "projectId": {{projectId}},
  "title": "首頁切版",
  "startDate": "2026-10-21",
  "dueDate": "2026-10-25",
  "predecessorIds": [{{taskA}}]
}

> {%
    client.global.set("taskB", response.body.data.id);
%}

### 7. 讓 A 以 B 為前置 → 形成循環，400
# @no-cookie-jar
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/task/{{taskA}}
Cookie: SPRING_CORE_SESSION={{session}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "predecessorIds": [{{taskB}}]
}

### 8. 新增 A 的子任務
# @no-cookie-jar
POST http://localhost:8080/api/task
Cookie: SPRING_CORE_SESSION={{session}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "projectId": {{projectId}},
  "parentId": {{taskA}},
  "title": "手機版版型"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("subtaskId", response.body.data.id);
%}

### 9. 看板拖曳：A 改為進行中，排在該欄第一個
# @no-cookie-jar
POST http://localhost:8080/api/task/{{taskA}}/move?status=IN_PROGRESS
Cookie: SPRING_CORE_SESSION={{session}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrf}}

### 10. 看板拖曳：B 也改為進行中，排在 A 之後
# @no-cookie-jar
POST http://localhost:8080/api/task/{{taskB}}/move?status=IN_PROGRESS&previousId={{taskA}}
Cookie: SPRING_CORE_SESSION={{session}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrf}}

### 11. 修改 A：延後到期日、清空預估工時
# @no-cookie-jar
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/task/{{taskA}}
Cookie: SPRING_CORE_SESSION={{session}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dueDate": "2026-10-22",
  "clearFields": ["estimateHours"]
}

### 12. 專案的主任務（看板用），依排序；帶子任務數與已登記工時
# @no-cookie-jar
POST http://localhost:8080/api/task/query
Cookie: SPRING_CORE_SESSION={{session}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "projectId": {{projectId}},
  "topLevel": true,
  "size": 100,
  "sort": [{ "field": "sortOrder", "direction": "asc" }]
}

### 13. 我的任務：不給 projectId 時只查得到指派給自己的
# @no-cookie-jar
POST http://localhost:8080/api/task/queryPage
Cookie: SPRING_CORE_SESSION={{session}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "statuses": ["TODO", "IN_PROGRESS", "REVIEW"],
  "sort": [{ "field": "dueDate", "direction": "asc" }]
}

### 14. 留言
# @no-cookie-jar
POST http://localhost:8080/api/task-comment
Cookie: SPRING_CORE_SESSION={{session}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "taskId": {{taskA}},
  "content": "版型初稿已上傳到設計稿"
}

### 15. 活動紀錄：建立、狀態、到期日變更與留言
# @no-cookie-jar
POST http://localhost:8080/api/task-activity/query
Cookie: SPRING_CORE_SESSION={{session}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "taskId": {{taskA}},
  "size": 100
}

### 16. 登記工時（userId 由系統填入登入者）
# @no-cookie-jar
POST http://localhost:8080/api/work-log
Cookie: SPRING_CORE_SESSION={{session}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "taskId": {{taskA}},
  "workDate": "2026-10-15",
  "hours": 3.5,
  "note": "初稿"
}

### 17. 不是 0.5 的倍數 → 400
# @no-cookie-jar
POST http://localhost:8080/api/work-log
Cookie: SPRING_CORE_SESSION={{session}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "taskId": {{taskA}},
  "workDate": "2026-10-15",
  "hours": 1.2
}

### 18. 專案工時統計：依人、日合計
# @no-cookie-jar
POST http://localhost:8080/api/work-log/summary
Cookie: SPRING_CORE_SESSION={{session}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "projectId": {{projectId}},
  "fromDate": "2026-10-01",
  "toDate": "2026-10-31"
}

### 19. A 還有子任務，不能刪 → 409
# @no-cookie-jar
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/task/{{taskA}}
Cookie: SPRING_CORE_SESSION={{session}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrf}}

### 20. 專案結案後唯讀：先結案，再改任務 → 400
# @no-cookie-jar
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/project/{{projectId}}
Cookie: SPRING_CORE_SESSION={{session}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "DONE"
}

###
# @no-cookie-jar
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/task/{{taskB}}
Cookie: SPRING_CORE_SESSION={{session}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "結案後不能改"
}

### 21. 重新開啟
# @no-cookie-jar
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/project/{{projectId}}
Cookie: SPRING_CORE_SESSION={{session}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}
